QPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which is the safest airline in the world in 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Etihad Airways (UAE) has been named the World's Safest Airline for 2026, followed closely by Qantas and Emirates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Emirates airline safe to fly?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, absolutely. Emirates is ranked #3 globally for safety in 2026. It operates one of the world's youngest fleets and has a dedicated flight training academy in Dubai.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How are airline safety rankings calculated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Rankings are based on crash records (over 10 years), fleet age, pilot training standards, and audits from government bodies like IATA and ICAO.\"}}]}]}</script><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"w-full mb-4\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"top-ten\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"World's Safest Airlines 2026: UAE’s Etihad Takes the Crown\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/world-safest-airlines-2026\"}]}</script><ol class=\"flex items-center text-sm space-x-2 overflow-hidden flex-wrap\"><li class=\"flex items-center shrink-0\"><a class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-[#4b0082] transition-colors flex items-center p-1 rounded hover:bg-black/5\" title=\"Back to Homepage\" aria-label=\"Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide 