9-23.414-44.543 23.414 8.512-49.594-36.031-35.125 49.797-7.234 22.265-45.122 22.262 45.122 49.805 7.234Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"drop-shadow-base\">The Safe Challenger</span></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-32 md:h-40 mt-10\"><img alt=\"Virgin Australia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/01b02995d924d67b1655af53e312641914ac51e5-500x500.png\"/></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6\"><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg> Editor&#x27;s Verdict</h3><p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium text-base md:text-base\">A perfect safety record in the jet era. Virgin Australia proves you don&#x27;t need to be a government giant to prioritize passenger safety, rounding out our 2026 list.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-3\"><div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-blue-600 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-base\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-1.5 rounded-md text-blue-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400\">IATA</div><div class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\">VA</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-blue-600 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-base\"><div class=\"bg-amber-50 p-1.5 rounded-md text-amber-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400\">Home Base</div><div class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 truncate\">Australia</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3 md:hidden\"><div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 rounded-md shadow-base text-green-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400\">Safety Score</div><div class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">7<!-- -->/7</div></div></div><a href=\"https://www.virginaustralia.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-base rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all shadow-base hover:shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 py-3 md:h-full\"><span class=\"md:hidden\">Visit Official Website</span><span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Visit Site</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-4 h-4 md:w-3 md:h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></article><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center py-2 opacity-40\"><div class=\"w-12 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-full\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"mt-12 prose prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-800 leading-relaxed bg-blue-50/50 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-blue-800 border-b border-blue-200 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold m-0! p-0!\">Traveler&#x27;s Guide &amp; Tips</h2></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">Expert Safety Tips for Your Next Flight</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Even when flying the world&#x27;s safest airlines, you can enhance your own security:</p><ol class=\"list-decimal ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary font-medium text-lg\"><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Check the Aircraft:</strong> When booking, look for newer models like the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">A350</strong> or <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">B787 Dreamliner</strong>, which have advanced turbulence-dampening tech.</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Count the Rows:</strong> Always count the rows to the nearest emergency exit (front and back). In an emergency, visibility might be low, and &quot;counting&quot; is more reliable than &quot;looking.&quot;</li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Listen to the Briefing:</strong> Aircraft configurations vary. Even frequent flyers should watch the safety demo to know exactly how <em>this specific</em> plane’s doors open.</li></ol></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-12\"><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50\"><h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\"><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">Which is the safest airline in the world in 2026?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Etihad Airways (UAE) has been named the World&#x27;s Safest Airline for 2026, followed closely by Qantas and Emirates.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">Is Emirates airline safe to fly?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Yes, absolutely. Emirates is ranked #3 globally for safety in 2026. It operates one of the world&#x27;s youngest fleets and has a dedicated flight training academy in Dubai.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">How are airline safety rankings calculated?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Rankings are based on crash records (over 10 years), fleet age, pilot training standards, and audits from government bodies like IATA and ICAO.</p></div></details></div></div></div></div></main><aside class=\"w-full lg:w-80 shrink-0 space-y-8 mt-12 lg:mt-0\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-primary/5 rounded-full translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gray-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-7 h-7 text-[#4b0082]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight\">Editorial Team</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider\">Expert Reviewe